---
import Policy from "../layouts/Policy.astro";
import { REFUND_ADDRESS, REMOVAL_ADDRESS } from "../lib/launch.ts";
---

<Policy title="Refunds">
  <p>
    The&nbsp;Rupee&nbsp;Fund is a FOSS United community initiative run by community members. We
    adopt the donation-refund principles in the FOSS United <a
      href="https://fossunited.org/refund-transfer-policy"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="inline-link">refund and transfer policy</a
    >, as reviewed on 7 September 2026: submit claims promptly, provide transaction details, and
    review donations made in error on an individual basis. The local rules below apply to this fund
    and take precedence where the source differs. Ticket-transfer rules do not apply. Later changes
    to the source do not change this policy automatically.
  </p>
  <h2>Before launch</h2>
  <p>
    This site takes no payments at this stage. Joining the launch notification list does not charge
    you or create a payment obligation. We will publish the payment recipient, refund contact, claim
    period, and recurring-payment cancellation process before contributions open.
  </p>
  <h2>Donations made to the Foundation</h2>
  <p>
    If you donated directly to FOSS United Foundation, its policy asks you to email{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${REFUND_ADDRESS}`} class="inline-link">{REFUND_ADDRESS}</a> within 15 days. That
    process concerns donations to the Foundation. It does not identify the Foundation as the recipient
    or refund decision-maker for future contributions to The&nbsp;Rupee&nbsp;Fund.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    For questions about The&nbsp;Rupee&nbsp;Fund, send an email to <a
      href={`mailto:${REMOVAL_ADDRESS}`}
      class="inline-link">{REMOVAL_ADDRESS}</a
    >.
  </p>
</Policy>
